# Out-of-tree driver-repo list for CactOS x86_64.
#
# One repository name per line; the "-for-Cact-x86_64" suffix is implied.
# Blank lines and everything after a '#' are ignored.
#
# The drivers no longer ride the localbinrepo image: they are packed into two
# Multiboot2 modules — Network-for-Cact-x86_64's `netdrvrepo` (the network
# drivers) and Driver-for-Cact-x86_64's `drvrepo` (everything else).  This file
# stays the workspace's union list of driver repositories (build.py resolves
# each one), while the contents of each archive are defined by that aggregator's
# own drivers.list — keep the three in sync.
AHCI
NVMe
Virtio-net
Yukon
Intel-HDA
EXT4
FAT32
USB-storage
